Flow discussed with Irfan:

 The user books a drive for 10 days in a future time (a few minutes to days)

# drive performs 0-amount pre-auth to validate card and wallets (we tokenize source behind wallet)
## we could challenge user (card 3ds), reject by fraud, etc
# some time before the actual order time
## drive performs pre-auth for booking amount {{longer_expiry:false}}
## drive performs pre-auth for deposit amount {{longer_expiry:true}}
# if these 3 payments are successful then only user will be able to start the car.

only 0-amount (first payment) will be with amount 0 and {{user_present}}. other 2 amounts will be with actual amount, {{user_not_present}}

