But the main problem not in init, but providers lock because of: 

{noformat}
The terraform providers lock command ignores the CLI configuration's provider installation settings in favor of its own arguments, and so by default it will retrieve the packages from the primary registry for each provider you are using and then calculate checksums based on those packages.{noformat}

So, added the repo, tested it, started to run without any issues or additional changes: 

